## Output
Return JSON only:
{
  "observations": [
    {
      "category": "decision",
      "subject": "short subject",
      "observation": "canonical sentence",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "confidence": 0.9,
      "candidate_ids": ["c-..."]
    }
  ]
}

Every observation must list one or more candidate_ids from the input. Do not add source IDs.
